@Book.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5268
@LivroId = 1
@AutorId = 1
@AssuntoId = 1
@AccessToken = cole-o-token-aqui

### Login
POST {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "book-admin",
  "password": "Book@123"
}

###

### Health
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Health live
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

### Health ready
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health/ready
Accept: application/json

###

### Relatorio de livros por autor
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/relatorios/livros-por-autor
Accept: application/json

###

### Relatorio de livros por autor filtrado
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/relatorios/livros-por-autor?autorNome=Martin
Accept: application/json

###

### Relatorio de livros por autor em PDF
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/relatorios/livros-por-autor/pdf
Accept: application/pdf

###

### Relatorio de livros por autor em PDF filtrado
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/relatorios/livros-por-autor/pdf?autorNome=Martin
Accept: application/pdf

###

### Listar livros
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/livros
Accept: application/json

###

### Obter livro por id
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/livros/{{LivroId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar livro
POST {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/livros
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "titulo": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "editora": "Alta Books",
  "edicao": 1,
  "anoPublicacao": "2024",
  "valor": 189.90
}

###

### Atualizar livro
PUT {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/livros/{{LivroId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "titulo": "DDD Tactical Patterns",
  "editora": "Alta Books",
  "edicao": 2,
  "anoPublicacao": "2025",
  "valor": 199.90
}

###

### Excluir livro
DELETE {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/livros/{{LivroId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Validar erros de entrada
POST {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/livros
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "titulo": "",
  "editora": "",
  "edicao": 0,
  "anoPublicacao": "20",
  "valor": -1
}

###

### Listar autores
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/autores
Accept: application/json

###

### Obter autor por id
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/autores/{{AutorId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar autor
POST {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/autores
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "nome": "Vaughn Vernon"
}

###

### Atualizar autor
PUT {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/autores/{{AutorId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "nome": "Vaughn Vernon Jr."
}

###

### Excluir autor
DELETE {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/autores/{{AutorId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Validar erro de autor
POST {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/autores
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "nome": ""
}

###

### Listar assuntos
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/assuntos
Accept: application/json

###

### Obter assunto por id
GET {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/assuntos/{{AssuntoId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Criar assunto
POST {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/assuntos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "descricao": "Microservices"
}

###

### Atualizar assunto
PUT {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/assuntos/{{AssuntoId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "descricao": "Microsservicos"
}

###

### Excluir assunto
DELETE {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/assuntos/{{AssuntoId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

###

### Validar erro de assunto
POST {{Book.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/assuntos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "descricao": ""
}

###
